  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Mainstreaming Human Security Approach in Syunik</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The purpose of the Project is to improve regional and community development planning process of the Syunik region of Armenia, by mainstreaming the concept of human security into existing norms, planning processes and institutions to systematically address the local insecurities and protect people from critical and pervasive threats.</narrative>
  </description>
